{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"TIT","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"提多書","commonName":"提多書","title":"提多書","order":56,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"3869f5bc4a8365b940b2a2341662aa5189de376890cda87a9ad345a80d108be5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/TIT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/TIT/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":46},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["教導純正的教義"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你的教導要符合純正的教義。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["勸年長的男子要節制、莊重、自律，有全備的信心、愛心和耐心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["勸年長的婦女要過敬虔的生活，不說長道短，不做酒的奴隸，要以身作則。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["這樣，她們就能教導年輕的婦女愛丈夫、愛兒女、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["自制、貞潔、持家、和善、順服丈夫，免得上帝的道被人毀謗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["勸勉年輕的男子要自制。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你自己要在各樣善行上作眾人的榜樣，在教導上要誠懇、認真、"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["言語純全、無可指責，讓那些反對的人無話可說、自覺羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["勸勉作奴僕的要凡事順服主人，讓主人滿意，不頂撞主人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["不偷拿主人的東西，為人要忠信可靠，好凡事尊崇我們救主上帝的教導。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因為上帝拯救世人的恩典已經顯明了，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["這恩典教導我們除掉不敬虔的心和世俗的私慾，在今世過自律、公義、敬畏上帝的生活，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["懷著美好的盼望等候我們偉大的上帝和救主耶穌基督的榮耀顯現。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["主耶穌為我們犧牲自己，要救贖我們脫離一切罪惡，並潔淨我們，使我們作祂熱心行善的子民。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你要講明這些事，充分運用權柄來勸勉人、責備人，別讓人輕看你。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/TIT/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/TIT/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/TIT/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}